<title>USA: CapStar completes D.C., Chicago hotel buys.</title>
<headline>CapStar completes D.C., Chicago hotel buys.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>CapStar Hotel Co said Wednesday it had completed the $60 million acquisition of the Georgetown Inn in Washington, D. C., and Radisson Hotel &amp; Suites in Chicago.</p>
<p>The hotels were purchased from Philadelphia-based Amerimar Enterprises and New York-based Angelo, Gordon &amp; Co. respectively, CapStar said.</p>
